  },
  {
   "title": "Anthropic:",
   "why": "the most-discussed private company, with sentiment sliding while IPO expectations rise ($2T, after the midterms). The gap between narrative and valuation is the story to track."
  },
  {
   "title": "Amazon:",
   "why": "cooling from strongly bullish (+0.9) to mixed (+0.4) on the Muse lock-out question. Chris Camillo flags next earnings as the test of Muse's impact on Bedrock and chips."
  },
  {
   "title": "Semis and space losing share of the conversation:",
   "why": "semis fell from 47% to 36% of briefs and space from 23% to 12%, while Dan Ives says chip equilibrium isn't until late 2028. Falling attention against a still-rising thesis can be a contrarian setup."
  },
  {
   "title": "Zcash and Instinct AI:",
   "why": "both new, both contested, both tied to the agent economy. Early enough that the next two weeks of mentions will show whether they spread or fade."
  }
